@startuml house-mode-trigger-lifecycle
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

state Detached
state Attached : tunable entity exposed,\nrestored value read
state Armed : listening for its time,\nstate, crossing or sun event

[*] --> Detached
Detached --> Attached : attach(context)
Attached --> Armed : arm(context, whenFired)
Armed --> Attached : disarm()
Armed --> Armed : fires:\nwhenFired(name)
Attached --> Detached : detach()
Armed --> Detached : detach()

note right of Attached
  fixed_time exposes a time entity,
  above/below a number entity;
  state and sun expose nothing.
  A value changed in Home Assistant
  is kept for the next arm().
end note

note right of Armed
  Armed: the selected strategy and
  every alwaysActive strategy.
  Selecting another strategy disarms
  the previous one. A value changed in
  Home Assistant re-arms with it.
end note
@enduml
